      "guid": "com.mattdokn.reachextender",
      "name": "Reach Extender",
      "slug": "reach-extender",
      "teaser": "Gives you one of those picker upper thingies.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1758.png",
      "downloads": 23144,
      "favourites_count": 32,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>You can now reach really far to open doors and containers, as well as picking up loot!</p>\n<p>Helps to scrub in those hard to reach areas!</p>\n<p>Config Options:</p>\n<p>- Loot/Container Interaction Distance: How far away you can open containers and pickup loot.</p>\n<p>- Door Interaction Distance: How far away you can open doors from.</p>\n<p><strong>Installation Instructions</strong></p>\n<p><strong>- unzip the file into your SPT Game folder.</strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support My Work</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Never feel obligated to donate for support.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mattdokn\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/mattdokn</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
